flowchart TD
 Input[Untrusted user content] --> Auth[Authenticate and authorize]
 Auth --> Validate[Validate fields, size and format]
 Validate --> Upload{Has image?}
 Upload -->|Yes| Inspect[Inspect actual file content]
 Upload -->|No| Sanitize[Sanitize rich HTML]
 Inspect --> Store[Store with generated name and access policy]
 Store --> Sanitize
 Sanitize --> Persist[Persist approved data]
 Persist --> Render[Render escaped text or sanitized HTML]
 Render -.-> Note[Proposed secure control flow, not a claim that every step exists today]
